@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Feature Specification: Task timestamps
+
+**Input**: Record when each task was created and last changed.
+
+## Requirements
+
+- **FR-001**: Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings.
+- **FR-002**: On `add`, the two are equal.
+- **FR-003**: Complete, reopen, rename, tag and untag set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes.
+- **FR-004**: A failed change leaves the task untouched.
+- **FR-005**: The domain reads no clock: `createTaskList` takes a time source; `createTodoList` (in `src/index.ts`) supplies the real clock, or an optional fake one for tests.
+
+## Plan / Tasks (done)
+
+- [x] `task.ts`: add fields; task operations take `now`.
+- [x] `list.ts`: `createTaskList(now)` threads the time into each change.
+- [x] `index.ts`: `createTodoList(now?)`.
+- [x] Tests in `test/list.test.ts`.
